  "preregistration_frozen_part_sha256": "0a5c7e061be57d24f382f24594c7d83a1ec68a4365ec6590c316d1d351ba0c85",
  "notes": [
    "The 17 protected blobs of the 2026-11-15 checkpoint plus the fast, matrix-free, dense-output, lagged and client-stage drivers and the adaptive controller.",
    "The 2026-11-15 checker stops passing once selection.rs changes; this checkpoint is the authority for loop L1.",
    "A passed trial merge (V02) replaces protected_blob_sha1 in a recorded step.",
    "Wave 1: golden oracle merged; trial merge not adopted (gates T2, T3 strict, T6 fail); V15 code stays on its branch.",
    "Epoch 2 starts at the adoption content commit; protected blobs are the post-merge bytes. The 2026-11-15 checker no longer applies.",
    "2026-11-17 wave 2 group 1: nodes V04, V06 (stage a) and V07 (stage a) merged after independent review; 10 implemented source files and 12 evidence files added to the identity lists. Stage-client stubs krylov.rs and speculative.rs are now implementations.",
    "2026-11-17: stage-client stub dense_lu_reuse.rs pre-seeded for node V18; mod.rs gains its module line.",
    "2026-11-23: node V21 stage b: opt-in stage client banded_tight.rs with its identity and allocation tests added by the orchestrator session; mod.rs gains its module line and re-export.",
    "2026-11-23 wave 2 group 2: nodes V03a, V17 and V16 merged after independent review (run wf_f2599e6f-a4a); 12 implemented source files and 12 evidence files added to or updated in the identity lists (stage_clients/krylov.rs changed by V17). Result files of the banded nodes V19 and V21 are added when their last measurements are in.",
    "2026-11-23: result files of the orchestrator-run nodes V19 (KILL) and V21 (PASS) added to the evidence list after their last measurements.",
    "2026-11-23: owner decisions OD-L1-9 to OD-L1-12 appended to OWNER_DECISIONS_20261116.json; its identity is updated.",
    "2026-11-23: epoch 3 opened. It holds the edits of protected files that the owner approved on 2026-11-23 (OD-L1-9 to OD-L1-12); the pins of epoch 2 are kept in the list of epochs. First edit, under OD-L1-12: workspace version 0.1.0 -> 0.2.0 in Cargo.toml and the six workspace package entries of Cargo.lock that take that version; no dependency changed.",
    "2026-11-23, epoch 3, node V22 under OD-L1-9: rodas5p_fast.rs gains one public function, rodas5p_fast_dense.rs two public functions, one identifier and a kernel parameter on two private functions (no existing public function changes), and crates/vigilode/src/lib.rs gains one re-export and a paragraph of route documentation. The sentinel test keeps its pins and allows one more lib.rs block (banded_kernel_route/SENTINEL_REPIN.json). The width constant of the facade is provisional (8) until the deciding series of the width scan.",
    "2026-11-23: owner decisions OD-L1-13 and OD-L1-14 appended to OWNER_DECISIONS_20261116.json; its identity is updated.",
    "2026-11-23: independent review of nodes V19 and V21 (banded_solve/REVIEW.json) added to the evidence list; the report of those nodes was regenerated after its corrections (result files unchanged).",
    "2026-11-23: review finding F08 of nodes V19 and V21: the fixed-width solve of BandedTightStageLu uses wrapping pivot differences (no overflow panic on a solve before a factorization) and the identity test file gains two tests; both identities updated.",
    "2026-11-23: node V03 part B (unified router) merged (cfbd2b18): unified_router/PREDECLARED.json, RECEIPT.json and REVIEW.json added to the evidence list and the twelve code paths of the node to the implemented sources (unified/analyzer.rs with the documentation correction of review finding F2); V03_UNIFIED_FRONTEND is COMPLETE_SCOPED in TASK_CONTRACTS.json and RESEARCH_DAG.json.",
    "2026-11-23: node V08 (finite-difference Jacobian assembly client) merged (bc8121cf) and corrected after its review (a7d1e824): jacobian_assembly/PREDECLARED.json, RESULTS.json and REVIEW.json added to the evidence list, the three source files and four test files of the client to the implemented sources; V08_JACOBIAN_ASSEMBLY is COMPLETE_SCOPED.",
    "2026-11-24: node V18 (dense LU client with storage reuse and opt-in worker threads) merged (406b2a3b) and annotated after its review (10356292): dense_lu_client/PREDECLARED.json, RESULTS.json and REVIEW.json added to the evidence list; the identity of the pre-seeded file stage_clients/dense_lu_reuse.rs is updated to the implemented client, and threaded.rs and three test files are added; V18_DENSE_LU_CLIENT is COMPLETE_SCOPED.",
    "2026-11-24: node V22 decided (commit 1cd674a6): BANDED_SLICES_MIN_HALF_WIDTH = 6; the identity of crates/vigilode/src/solve.rs is updated, the golden file of the banded routes is added to the implemented sources and banded_kernel_route/RESULTS.json to the evidence list; V22_FACADE_BANDED_KERNEL is COMPLETE_SCOPED with its independent review still to run.",
    "2026-11-24: node V24 merged (28f3ad86, 9daf78fd), epoch 3, owner decision OD-L1-11: the protected blob crates/rodas5p-integrators/src/rodas5p_matrix_free_fast.rs is re-pinned (a3896e3a751cf921f83ac1e5f5e6a20bb64f7676 to 8c389ca973568402125b48e5574304d31640e9d2); it gains the opt-in policy of the stage solve and its shipped policy is bit-identical (discriminator D0). The sentinel test files ppsw1_6b_contracts.rs and ptsw2b_contracts.rs, gmres_staged.rs, routing.rs and five new test files are in the implemented sources; six evidence files of mf_adaptive are added. Frozen verdict FAIL: the default of the matrix-free route is unchanged.",
    "2026-11-24: owner decisions OD-L1-15 to OD-L1-18 appended to OWNER_DECISIONS_20261116.json (identity updated); nodes V25 and V26 pre-registered (addendum A7, mf_p1_confirm/PREDECLARED.json and assembly_check/PREDECLARED.json added to the evidence list); node V27 is a design phase.",
    "2026-11-24: owner decision OD-L1-19 appended (identity updated): the CI test jobs run a change-based selection (tools/ci/select_tests.py); the whole suite runs before the release.",
    "2026-11-24: owner decision OD-L1-20 appended (identity updated): coverage-based selection inside a crate."
  ],
